WEBVTT

01:30.080 --> 01:34.930
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.240 --> 01:37.910
[Episode 36]

01:39.950 --> 01:41.130
As long as you live,

01:41.479 --> 01:43.210
I'll make you suffer every day.

01:47.000 --> 01:48.259
Can't take it anymore?

01:49.039 --> 01:50.039
I knew it.

01:50.310 --> 01:51.610
A human like you

01:51.680 --> 01:53.590
could never make her happy.

01:55.039 --> 01:56.050
But if you promise

01:56.840 --> 01:58.850
to never see Xiao Yao again,

01:59.289 --> 02:00.300
I'll let you go.

02:04.570 --> 02:05.560
Say it.

02:07.340 --> 02:08.669
Say it.

02:10.039 --> 02:10.910
Say it out loud!

02:15.190 --> 02:16.590
Why aren't you speaking?

02:16.750 --> 02:18.079
Promise me you won't see her again,

02:18.079 --> 02:19.360
and I'll end your suffering.

02:19.360 --> 02:20.340
Just say it.

02:20.710 --> 02:21.670
Say it!

02:25.400 --> 02:27.400
If I can see her again,

02:29.880 --> 02:31.220
this little suffering

02:32.150 --> 02:33.960
means nothing to me.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.760
Even if I kill you,

02:50.240 --> 02:52.240
Yao probably still won't like me.

02:57.180 --> 02:58.350
I can let you go.

02:59.480 --> 03:00.610
But you must promise

03:01.080 --> 03:02.610
that for as long as you live,

03:02.960 --> 03:03.960
you will never...

03:07.550 --> 03:08.890
Never

03:10.100 --> 03:11.120
betray her.

03:26.610 --> 03:29.010
Do you really think
I don't dare to kill you?

03:30.910 --> 03:32.710
You are pure and sacred,

03:33.410 --> 03:36.010
and shouldn't coexist with
the filthy humans.

03:36.240 --> 03:37.640
On the day of the eclipse,

03:38.030 --> 03:39.490
you should have killed me.

03:41.650 --> 03:43.450
But instead, you healed my hand,

03:44.870 --> 03:46.870
making me think of you day and night.

03:47.870 --> 03:49.000
For my Ao Hen Clan,

03:49.750 --> 03:51.240
cultivation is a battle.

03:51.780 --> 03:53.290
We fall when defeated,

03:53.910 --> 03:56.170
and lick our own wounds when victorious.

03:56.430 --> 03:57.760
For thousands of years,

03:58.430 --> 04:00.350
you're the only one
to have ever tended to my wounds.

04:00.350 --> 04:01.950
I only helped you out of pity,

04:02.010 --> 04:03.120
nothing more.

04:04.200 --> 04:05.730
I won't force you to like me.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.490
But I will do my utmost

04:09.750 --> 04:11.610
to do anything that benefits you.

04:12.280 --> 04:14.080
And I will completely eliminate

04:14.960 --> 04:16.899
anything that harms you.

04:16.920 --> 04:18.390
How could you possibly know better than me

04:18.390 --> 04:20.149
what's best for me?

04:22.630 --> 04:24.160
Thank you for your concern,

04:24.640 --> 04:26.840
but please stop meddling in my affairs.

04:31.270 --> 04:32.909
I'm asking you one last time.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.130
Where is Hong Ye?

04:40.600 --> 04:41.670
I swear,

04:42.360 --> 04:44.020
if you just give me one chance,

04:46.360 --> 04:48.620
I'll protect you for ten thousand years.

05:08.480 --> 05:09.160
Yao!

05:17.610 --> 05:18.240
Yao—

05:22.510 --> 05:23.490
Xiao Yao.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.400
I'm sorry.

05:39.040 --> 05:40.140
I'm late.

05:46.510 --> 05:47.250
Let's go.

06:06.950 --> 06:08.280
Your behavior

06:09.360 --> 06:11.110
is truly disgraceful.

06:13.950 --> 06:15.680
Did you think I couldn't see

06:16.430 --> 06:18.430
how much you've made Hong Ye suffer?

06:19.870 --> 06:22.950
At least I never truly wanted to kill him.

06:23.390 --> 06:24.880
How does it feel

06:25.070 --> 06:27.330
to hand Hong Ye over to Xiao Yao yourself?

06:27.600 --> 06:29.330
Better than having Yao hate me.

06:30.950 --> 06:33.350
After cultivating for thousands of years,

06:33.890 --> 06:36.020
both of us are no match for a mere human.

06:36.120 --> 06:37.070
Is your mouth

06:38.409 --> 06:40.260
laced with poison?

06:48.000 --> 06:48.680
Hong Ye!

06:56.930 --> 06:59.060
Your meridians aren't like a demon's.

06:59.080 --> 07:02.280
I can only temporarily suppress
the turmoil in your body.

07:05.040 --> 07:05.970
When we return to the Dragon Palace,

07:05.970 --> 07:07.370
we'll heal you properly.

07:10.720 --> 07:13.180
I won't go back
to the Dragon Palace with you.

07:14.830 --> 07:16.760
I will protect you well from now on.

07:17.360 --> 07:19.360
I won't let any demon hurt you again.

07:20.430 --> 07:22.290
You've already helped me so much.

07:24.490 --> 07:26.890
I can't always hide under your protection.

07:28.240 --> 07:30.160
And I can't become your burden.

07:31.390 --> 07:32.430
Don't say that.

07:35.000 --> 07:35.800
Xiao Yao.

07:38.040 --> 07:38.870
Thank you.

07:40.950 --> 07:42.720
During our time together,

07:43.870 --> 07:45.310
you've given me respect.

07:46.070 --> 07:47.600
You've also made me believe

07:47.920 --> 07:48.630
that humans

07:49.190 --> 07:49.870
and demons

07:50.630 --> 07:52.270
can coexist peacefully.

07:53.760 --> 07:55.280
But once I leave you,

07:56.630 --> 07:58.870
whether it's dragons or other demons,

08:00.900 --> 08:02.730
their attitude toward humans

08:04.390 --> 08:06.120
will remain the same as before.

08:07.390 --> 08:10.670
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

08:07.990 --> 08:09.850
Everything that happened today

08:11.640 --> 08:14.900
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

08:13.070 --> 08:15.870
just made me see reality more clearly.

08:21.390 --> 08:24.770
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

08:25.190 --> 08:26.870
The demons' attitude toward humans

08:25.670 --> 08:29.960
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

08:27.630 --> 08:29.300
is deeply rooted

08:30.240 --> 08:31.700
and impossible to change.

08:33.390 --> 08:35.669
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

08:34.630 --> 08:35.480
So,

08:36.870 --> 08:39.130
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

08:37.370 --> 08:39.030
whether for humanity

08:40.000 --> 08:42.270
or to be with you in a better way,

08:40.169 --> 08:44.380
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

08:43.870 --> 08:46.470
I will find the Yuli Spring
as soon as possible.

08:47.620 --> 08:49.910
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

08:47.970 --> 08:48.730
You...

08:50.510 --> 08:52.270
In order to be with me?

08:50.910 --> 08:53.340
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

08:55.800 --> 08:57.780
♪ Boiling hot ♪

08:57.010 --> 08:57.810
That's right.

09:02.570 --> 09:06.850
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

09:07.760 --> 09:12.050
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

09:12.680 --> 09:14.790
I used to be too insecure.

09:13.110 --> 09:15.910
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

09:16.230 --> 09:18.270
I always questioned
if your kindness toward me

09:17.110 --> 09:18.580
♪ The chains of fate ♪

09:19.190 --> 09:20.610
was a joke

09:19.570 --> 09:23.070
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

09:21.450 --> 09:22.710
or your true feelings.

09:24.120 --> 09:27.710
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

09:24.710 --> 09:26.640
I was afraid of presuming too much,

09:28.530 --> 09:30.330
but I still wanted to see you.

09:28.550 --> 09:29.970
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

09:31.170 --> 09:32.460
♪ Both flushing ♪

09:31.240 --> 09:33.370
And in this back-and-forth thinking,

09:33.530 --> 09:37.100
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

09:34.840 --> 09:36.130
your image

09:37.120 --> 09:39.240
has become unforgettable in my heart.

09:38.180 --> 09:43.100
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

09:45.470 --> 09:47.340
♪ Moments ♪

09:47.270 --> 09:48.750
You can talk so much.

09:49.630 --> 09:51.030
Seems like you won't die.

09:57.220 --> 09:59.610
When I was in unbearable pain earlier,

10:01.360 --> 10:03.370
I kept telling myself

10:05.170 --> 10:06.250
that if I could

10:06.830 --> 10:09.270
♪ The armor I dare not cast away ♪

10:07.440 --> 10:08.910
see you again today,

10:10.270 --> 10:12.160
I would give you

10:10.270 --> 10:12.760
♪ The red cheeks ♪

10:14.630 --> 10:15.840
my heart.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.290
♪ Cold ♪

10:21.050 --> 10:23.460
♪ I'm afraid it's a dream ♪

10:22.790 --> 10:24.540
I am grateful that you deign to accept me.

10:24.540 --> 10:26.190
♪ A thousand years is just ♪

10:25.980 --> 10:27.670
It's yours now.

10:27.060 --> 10:31.810
♪ A fleeting moment's grand display ♪

10:35.940 --> 10:40.220
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

10:41.220 --> 10:45.560
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

10:43.510 --> 10:44.270
Hong Ye.

10:46.620 --> 10:49.370
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

10:46.770 --> 10:49.100
Do you really have to find
the Yuli Spring?

10:50.440 --> 10:51.940
♪ The chains of fate ♪

10:50.960 --> 10:53.560
The Yuli Spring
will disrupt the world's balance.

10:52.900 --> 10:56.680
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

10:55.270 --> 10:56.510
If it's really found,

10:57.430 --> 11:01.190
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

10:58.030 --> 10:59.560
it might not be a good thing.

11:00.800 --> 11:02.880
A human's life is too short.

11:02.040 --> 11:03.500
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

11:04.570 --> 11:06.080
♪ Both flushing ♪

11:04.660 --> 11:07.410
I just want to do my best to reduce
the gap between humans and demons.

11:07.020 --> 11:10.630
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

11:08.890 --> 11:10.670
I want to stay with you longer.

11:11.560 --> 11:16.690
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

11:20.020 --> 11:23.470
♪ Moments ♪

11:20.480 --> 11:21.120
Very well.

11:23.960 --> 11:25.160
I'll escort you back.

11:25.750 --> 11:26.120
Okay.

11:38.240 --> 11:39.770
This is a dragon bone flute.

11:40.120 --> 11:41.550
If you need to find me,

11:41.690 --> 11:42.780
just sound it,

11:43.270 --> 11:45.670
and I'll hear it
from a thousand miles away.

11:54.670 --> 11:55.360
All right.

11:56.270 --> 11:57.730
Take care of yourself too.

12:53.270 --> 12:54.240
Father.

13:00.870 --> 13:01.620
Father.

13:10.720 --> 13:11.390
Father.

13:11.790 --> 13:12.480
Father.

13:16.830 --> 13:17.640
Father.

13:18.960 --> 13:19.900
Look at me.

13:20.440 --> 13:21.620
I'm Ye.

13:22.630 --> 13:23.630
I have returned.

13:24.670 --> 13:25.360
Father.

13:26.000 --> 13:26.670
Father.

13:28.600 --> 13:29.320
Father!

13:31.910 --> 13:32.760
Father.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.390
Prince Ye,

14:14.400 --> 14:15.670
you've finally returned.

14:15.670 --> 14:17.030
Who did this?

14:18.340 --> 14:19.890
The Ao Hen Clan.

14:21.150 --> 14:22.370
You led the fleet

14:22.640 --> 14:25.480
to search for the celestial mountain
and didn't return for over a month.

14:25.480 --> 14:28.030
We sent search parties again and again,

14:29.060 --> 14:30.960
but in the end, along the shore,

14:31.140 --> 14:33.400
we only found the wreckage of your fleet.

14:34.290 --> 14:36.160
Everyone thought you had perished,

14:36.160 --> 14:38.760
and the emperor
fell gravely ill because of it.

14:39.600 --> 14:40.720
Just recently,

14:40.920 --> 14:43.250
news came from a southern fishing village

14:43.910 --> 14:45.750
that villagers had seen you.

14:46.750 --> 14:49.080
The emperor rose from his sickbed,

14:49.120 --> 14:51.180
saying he wanted to welcome you home.

14:51.360 --> 14:53.090
He was planning to leave today,

14:53.480 --> 14:55.120
but unexpectedly,

14:56.000 --> 14:58.530
the Ao Hen Clan
descended from the sky just now

14:58.750 --> 15:00.630
and destroyed everything they could!

15:00.630 --> 15:01.550
We have failed.

15:01.810 --> 15:03.670
We couldn't protect the emperor.

15:04.080 --> 15:04.970
Prince Ye,

15:05.720 --> 15:07.780
the human race is now in grave danger.

15:08.750 --> 15:10.870
Since you have returned safely,

15:11.840 --> 15:14.330
we beg you
to immediately ascend the throne.

15:14.510 --> 15:17.600
Lead humanity in continuing
the search for the Yuli Spring

15:17.600 --> 15:19.190
to give our race

15:19.480 --> 15:21.550
a glimmer of hope in this world.

15:22.390 --> 15:25.190
Since the demons haven't
wiped out all humans yet,

15:26.440 --> 15:28.650
I shall borrow the power of heaven

15:29.120 --> 15:31.630
to fight for humanity's future.

15:32.030 --> 15:35.200
Long live Emperor Ye!

15:39.910 --> 15:41.470
Heaven and earth,

15:41.960 --> 15:43.650
the origin of all energy.

15:48.270 --> 15:50.270
Within and beyond the Three Realms,

15:50.390 --> 15:52.290
only the Way is supreme.

15:56.880 --> 15:58.600
Encompassing heaven and earth,

15:58.600 --> 16:00.370
it nurtures all living beings.

16:05.150 --> 16:06.810
Profound wisdom penetrates,

16:07.120 --> 16:08.850
as the five energies rise.

16:11.790 --> 16:13.240
The human emperor

16:13.360 --> 16:14.960
prays for heaven's mandate,

16:14.960 --> 16:16.430
seeking divine guidance

16:16.480 --> 16:18.070
to find the Yuli Spring

16:18.200 --> 16:21.790
and protect all people
from suffering and hardship.

16:37.000 --> 16:39.800
The celestial mountain
and Yuli have not appeared

16:40.080 --> 16:43.570
because humans
have not shown true sincerity.

16:50.010 --> 16:51.670
Deity, I beg you for guidance.

16:51.980 --> 16:53.940
I am willing to find the Yuli

16:55.870 --> 16:57.080
at any cost.

16:58.410 --> 17:00.120
As with all things in the world,

17:00.120 --> 17:02.430
if you desire it intensely,

17:02.530 --> 17:04.760
you will become enlightened.

17:05.829 --> 17:07.859
If humans wish to become powerful,

17:08.160 --> 17:10.640
they must first have a powerful heart.

17:11.640 --> 17:13.400
Then will you be able to carry

17:13.400 --> 17:16.270
the divine power bestowed upon you.

17:17.349 --> 17:18.440
I, Hong Ye,

17:20.640 --> 17:22.770
am willing to receive divine power...

17:28.270 --> 17:29.910
with my mortal body.

17:51.770 --> 17:53.320
I grant you power

17:53.850 --> 17:55.460
to aid your cultivation.

17:55.960 --> 17:57.750
If you find Yuli,

17:57.790 --> 18:00.160
only then
can the divine power be passed on.

18:00.160 --> 18:02.850
Otherwise, humans cannot be saved,

18:03.210 --> 18:04.960
and extinction would be justified.

18:04.960 --> 18:07.020
How exactly can I prove myself

18:07.920 --> 18:10.130
to find Yuli?

18:20.210 --> 18:23.860
Each demon tribe has passed down

18:23.890 --> 18:26.490
a pearl that condenses
the primordial spirit.

18:27.550 --> 18:29.590
Gather all eight pearls

18:29.660 --> 18:33.550
and the celestial mountain
and Yuli will descend for you.

19:40.030 --> 19:40.830
Your Majesty,

19:40.850 --> 19:42.930
drawing like this
is harmful to your health.

19:42.930 --> 19:43.800
You must stop.

19:44.800 --> 19:46.070
The deity has shown mercy,

19:46.070 --> 19:47.130
granting me power.

19:47.940 --> 19:49.600
If I don't protect humans now,

19:49.720 --> 19:50.920
what am I waiting for?

19:56.120 --> 19:56.970
What is this?

20:02.350 --> 20:04.620
Distribute these divine talismans
to everyone.

20:04.620 --> 20:05.560
Keep them close.

20:06.070 --> 20:07.610
If you encounter ordinary demons,

20:07.610 --> 20:09.160
these will shield you
from their demonic power.

20:09.160 --> 20:09.480
Yes.

20:13.920 --> 20:15.780
Congratulations, Your Majesty.

20:16.070 --> 20:19.070
Several guards empowered with divine power
went to patrol the mountains

20:19.070 --> 20:21.240
and surprisingly captured a demonic beast.

20:21.240 --> 20:23.350
This is the first time we humans
have seen a demonic beast

20:23.350 --> 20:24.550
without having to flee,

20:24.550 --> 20:26.150
and instead brought it back.

20:27.000 --> 20:28.160
What kind of beast is it?

20:28.160 --> 20:29.160
An illusion beast

20:30.030 --> 20:31.630
with no power to harm humans.

20:51.510 --> 20:53.510
Illusion beasts are extremely rare.

20:53.510 --> 20:56.040
They survive in the world
through illusions.

20:56.270 --> 20:57.640
Though they have little power,

20:57.640 --> 20:59.510
they can transform at will,

20:59.590 --> 21:01.520
deceiving both demons and humans.

21:02.400 --> 21:04.500
If this demon serves us,

21:04.790 --> 21:06.450
it will surely be beneficial.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.030
How so?

21:42.790 --> 21:44.810
Though you have gained divine power,

21:44.810 --> 21:46.630
the power gap between you

21:46.830 --> 21:48.640
and the many demons remains vast.

21:48.640 --> 21:50.640
Why not fight poison with poison

21:50.920 --> 21:52.110
and use this illusion beast

21:52.110 --> 21:53.550
to sow discord among demons?

21:53.550 --> 21:55.200
Only then can we gather all pearls,

21:55.200 --> 21:57.700
proving our sincerity to the deity.

22:02.750 --> 22:03.550
Your Majesty,

22:04.030 --> 22:07.020
this is the only way
to gather all the pearls.

22:12.060 --> 22:13.830
The demons slaughter humans

22:13.830 --> 22:16.020
using the most extreme methods.

22:16.400 --> 22:17.270
Your Majesty,

22:17.680 --> 22:19.030
you bear a deep blood feud.

22:19.030 --> 22:19.630
Now,

22:19.880 --> 22:21.540
you have a way to take revenge.

22:21.680 --> 22:23.920
Why are you showing mercy to the demons?

22:29.830 --> 22:31.830
Which clan do you want to start with?

22:32.440 --> 22:35.330
Those who most enjoyed bullying humans

22:35.640 --> 22:37.100
were the mountain demons.

22:37.510 --> 22:38.900
Let's start with them.

22:59.270 --> 23:00.440
Hand over the Earth Pearl

23:00.440 --> 23:01.830
and your lives will be spared.

23:01.830 --> 23:02.560
Ridiculous!

23:03.170 --> 23:05.960
The mountain demon tribe
has guarded this pearl for generations.

23:05.960 --> 23:07.090
You'll never get it.

23:11.830 --> 23:13.720
If all mountain demons die,

23:13.740 --> 23:14.920
there will be no point

23:14.920 --> 23:16.460
in guarding the pearl.

23:20.000 --> 23:21.450
Spare their lives

23:22.000 --> 23:23.790
and I'll take you to get the Earth Pearl.

23:23.790 --> 23:24.310
Leader,

23:24.810 --> 23:25.810
you can't!

23:26.550 --> 23:27.870
After this disaster,

23:27.920 --> 23:30.780
our tribe no longer has the power
to guard the pearl.

23:31.110 --> 23:32.790
We must preserve some of our bloodline

23:32.790 --> 23:34.760
to prevent complete extinction.

23:37.790 --> 23:39.000
Follow me.

24:30.850 --> 24:32.990
The Earth Pearl has the power of life.

24:33.410 --> 24:35.270
One must respect all natural beings

24:35.270 --> 24:36.800
to receive its protection.

24:42.070 --> 24:42.610
Let's go.

24:48.750 --> 24:49.410
Leader!

25:02.410 --> 25:03.140
Dragon Lord,

25:03.350 --> 25:06.750
the Bi Fang Clan's
Wind-Settling Pearl has also been stolen.

25:08.750 --> 25:10.350
Various clans are facing trouble
one after another now.

25:10.350 --> 25:12.570
Rumors say the Ao Hen Clan
uses extremely treacherous methods.

25:12.570 --> 25:14.350
Should we also prepare
some countermeasures?

25:14.350 --> 25:16.600
If the Dragon Lord
hadn't shown mercy before,

25:16.600 --> 25:18.310
Ao Hen wouldn't even exist anymore.

25:18.310 --> 25:20.440
Although his reputation isn't great,

25:20.550 --> 25:22.890
he's never been this vicious before.

25:22.980 --> 25:25.980
Could it be that when you spared him
for Hong Ye's sake,

25:26.050 --> 25:28.250
it completely disrupted Ao Hen's mind?

25:30.010 --> 25:31.270
Though he's ruthless,

25:31.720 --> 25:33.840
he's not one for indiscriminate killing.

25:33.840 --> 25:35.180
Besides, after the solar eclipse,

25:35.180 --> 25:37.710
he experienced the benefits
of cultivation.

25:37.790 --> 25:39.600
He surely wouldn't act this way.

25:39.780 --> 25:41.240
I fear that while mountains
and rivers may change,

25:41.240 --> 25:42.970
one's nature remains the same.

25:43.030 --> 25:44.440
Report!

25:47.160 --> 25:48.000
Qiong Qi's leader has brought

25:48.000 --> 25:50.270
the leaders of Lei Meng, Fox,
Mountain Demon, and Bi Fang Clans.

25:50.270 --> 25:51.790
They're all waiting outside.

25:51.790 --> 25:52.450
Let them in.

25:52.720 --> 25:53.270
Yes.

25:59.160 --> 25:59.960
Dragon Lord,

26:00.550 --> 26:02.480
Ao Hen's actions are disgraceful.

26:02.480 --> 26:03.880
Such a disgrace to demon-kind

26:03.880 --> 26:05.010
must be eliminated.

26:05.030 --> 26:06.750
The Fox Clan has already suffered

26:06.750 --> 26:07.720
multiple raids from the Ao Hen Clan.

26:07.720 --> 26:10.240
It's one thing
that our tribe is weaker than theirs,

26:10.240 --> 26:11.350
but our repeated concessions

26:11.350 --> 26:12.960
only made them more aggressive.

26:12.960 --> 26:14.310
They kill innocents

26:14.310 --> 26:15.480
with vicious methods.

26:15.480 --> 26:17.030
Even after I handed over
the Thunder Pearl,

26:17.030 --> 26:19.070
they still slaughtered my people,

26:19.070 --> 26:22.800
cutting off the foundation
for future generations' cultivation!

26:22.920 --> 26:24.250
The Mountain Demon Clan

26:24.720 --> 26:26.270
only has a few remaining now.

26:26.270 --> 26:27.510
I watched helplessly

26:27.510 --> 26:29.030
as my entire clan, including our leader,

26:29.030 --> 26:30.350
died before my eyes!

26:30.720 --> 26:32.750
Though there have been
conflicts between clans,

26:32.750 --> 26:35.120
none have been as ruthless as Ao Hen.

26:35.310 --> 26:37.160
Dragon Lord, since you've
achieved Azure Dragon form,

26:37.160 --> 26:39.510
if you still stand by
and do nothing like before,

26:39.510 --> 26:41.830
then you're simply enabling
the Ao Hen Clan.

26:41.830 --> 26:42.270
Indeed.

26:42.270 --> 26:43.030
That's right.

26:43.030 --> 26:45.400
The dragons cannot stand idle!

26:45.400 --> 26:46.400
Please, Azure Dragon, help us.

26:46.400 --> 26:47.510
Please bring justice, Azure Dragon.

26:47.510 --> 26:47.790
Yes.

26:50.640 --> 26:51.370
Dragon Lord.

26:51.960 --> 26:53.290
Ao Hen ambushed my clan.

26:53.720 --> 26:55.250
You witnessed it yourself.

26:55.290 --> 26:56.610
As the Azure Dragon,

26:56.790 --> 26:58.310
committed to protecting all beings,

26:58.310 --> 26:59.920
surely you will be fair.

27:00.920 --> 27:02.380
We've come today

27:02.550 --> 27:04.210
in hopes that you would lead us

27:04.390 --> 27:05.500
to gather all clans

27:05.920 --> 27:07.370
and punish Ao Hen together!

27:07.370 --> 27:08.520
Punish Ao Hen!

27:08.550 --> 27:10.350
Yes, punish him!

27:10.350 --> 27:11.720
Yes, punish Ao Hen!

27:11.720 --> 27:12.640
Punish Ao Hen!

27:12.640 --> 27:14.400
Punish Ao Hen!

27:15.790 --> 27:17.250
Though Ao Hen is powerful,

27:17.790 --> 27:20.850
he doesn't have the ability
to fight all demons at once.

27:20.880 --> 27:22.510
If he truly acts this way,

27:22.640 --> 27:25.440
it only harms others
without benefiting himself.

27:25.680 --> 27:26.480
I think

27:27.030 --> 27:28.960
this matter is highly suspicious.

27:29.510 --> 27:30.240
Dragon Lord,

27:31.240 --> 27:32.260
the Ao Hen Clan

27:32.310 --> 27:34.310
has been pillaging and killing for years,

27:34.310 --> 27:36.200
constantly improving their power.

27:36.200 --> 27:38.070
They must think
that their cultivation is complete

27:38.070 --> 27:40.070
and now, they want to rule the world.

27:41.440 --> 27:43.500
Why do you hesitate?

27:44.680 --> 27:47.090
Rumors say that Ao Hen
and the Azure Dragon

27:47.270 --> 27:48.800
have a close relationship.

27:48.960 --> 27:50.000
Could it be

27:50.590 --> 27:52.340
you're favoring Ao Hen?

27:55.310 --> 27:55.840
Lei Meng.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.440
You're worried,

28:00.720 --> 28:02.920
but you shouldn't speak such nonsense.

28:04.000 --> 28:04.720
Otherwise,

28:05.510 --> 28:07.640
I will be the first to turn against you.

28:09.400 --> 28:11.310
Our clan is facing extinction.

28:11.830 --> 28:13.490
What do I have to fear from you?

28:15.400 --> 28:16.130
Come on then!

28:16.750 --> 28:17.950
I'm not afraid of you!

28:17.960 --> 28:18.790
Stop arguing!

28:20.160 --> 28:22.090
Punishing Ao Hen isn't difficult,

28:22.590 --> 28:24.110
but if there are forces behind this

28:24.110 --> 28:25.970
stirring conflict among demons,

28:26.110 --> 28:28.310
wouldn't we be falling into their trap?

28:29.270 --> 28:30.680
Everyone, return home for now.

28:30.680 --> 28:32.880
Take care of your people and treasures,

28:33.030 --> 28:34.490
and repair your barriers.

28:34.640 --> 28:36.040
I will find Ao Hen myself.

28:37.030 --> 28:38.430
Once I uncover the truth,

28:38.750 --> 28:40.610
I'll give you all an explanation.

28:41.350 --> 28:42.410
What if everything

28:43.350 --> 28:44.680
truly is Ao Hen's doing?

28:48.350 --> 28:49.750
I will eliminate the evil

28:50.570 --> 28:51.840
and show no mercy.

29:15.640 --> 29:18.700
This is the first time
you've approached me on your own.

29:24.300 --> 29:25.840
I've always thought

29:26.190 --> 29:27.920
I needed to find the Yuli Spring

29:28.480 --> 29:29.880
and achieve immortality

29:30.090 --> 29:32.020
before I could be with you forever.

29:32.350 --> 29:33.960
But today's chaos

29:34.640 --> 29:36.260
has made me realize

29:37.640 --> 29:39.250
that if I were to die one day,

29:40.240 --> 29:42.100
the only thing I would worry about

29:43.290 --> 29:45.090
would be the bond I have with you.

29:47.620 --> 29:48.960
You're different

29:49.310 --> 29:50.160
from before.

29:51.240 --> 29:52.310
Life is short.

29:53.190 --> 29:54.790
I can't control everything.

29:55.910 --> 29:57.080
If that's the case,

29:57.510 --> 29:58.710
what I want to do most,

29:58.960 --> 30:00.510
and the only thing I can do,

30:02.790 --> 30:04.510
is to tell you how I feel.

30:40.310 --> 30:42.500
With a strand of my hair
representing my love,

30:42.500 --> 30:44.760
I formally ask for your hand in marriage.

30:46.830 --> 30:48.640
Will you tie your fate with mine

30:49.900 --> 30:51.100
until the end of time?

31:02.170 --> 31:04.140
Perhaps I'm being too abrupt.

31:35.510 --> 31:36.320
I'm willing.

32:02.130 --> 32:02.720
Hong Ye,

32:03.510 --> 32:04.880
the reason I came here

32:05.980 --> 32:07.300
was to find you.

32:09.200 --> 32:11.660
You are the very reason
of my existence here.

32:13.400 --> 32:14.050
Xiao Yao.

32:16.480 --> 32:18.540
No matter what happens in the future,

32:19.590 --> 32:20.550
remember this:

32:21.560 --> 32:22.350
everything I do is only

32:22.350 --> 32:24.550
so I can stand by your side
as your equal.

32:27.790 --> 32:28.880
Between us,

32:29.140 --> 32:30.670
there is not only equality,

32:31.000 --> 32:31.730
but also

32:32.790 --> 32:34.990
love at first sight that lasts forever.

32:38.470 --> 32:41.070
Next month, August 15th,
in the human calendar

32:41.070 --> 32:42.630
will be our wedding day.

32:42.880 --> 32:43.810
Is that alright?

32:46.110 --> 32:46.590
Yes.

32:52.820 --> 32:54.270
That's absolutely not acceptable.

32:54.270 --> 32:56.240
How could a human
be worthy of the Azure Dragon?

32:56.240 --> 32:57.240
Yes, Dragon Lord.

32:57.270 --> 32:58.640
There has never been

32:58.720 --> 33:00.750
a precedent of marriage
between demons and humans.

33:00.750 --> 33:02.200
Please reconsider, Dragon Lord.

33:02.200 --> 33:06.060
-Please reconsider, Dragon Lord!
-Please reconsider, Dragon Lord!

33:07.180 --> 33:08.040
Dragon Lord...

33:10.920 --> 33:13.380
If everything always followed old customs,

33:13.880 --> 33:15.030
there would be no Azure Dragon either.

33:15.030 --> 33:15.760
Dragon Lord,

33:16.310 --> 33:17.640
you and Hong Ye

33:18.200 --> 33:19.750
have only known each other
for a short time.

33:19.750 --> 33:22.440
This... things are moving too fast.

33:22.550 --> 33:23.110
-Yes.
-Yes.

33:23.110 --> 33:24.070
Things are moving too fast.

33:24.070 --> 33:25.400
Since when has the depth of love

33:25.400 --> 33:27.620
been measured
by the length of acquaintance?

33:27.620 --> 33:28.100
Well...

33:29.310 --> 33:30.040
Dragon Lord.

33:30.960 --> 33:33.000
I'm afraid a human would marry a dragon

33:33.000 --> 33:34.640
just so they can use
the dragon clan's power

33:34.640 --> 33:36.500
to help them find the Yuli Spring.

33:37.480 --> 33:38.350
Rumors of this spring

33:38.350 --> 33:40.410
has now spread among all demon clans.

33:40.480 --> 33:42.550
The claim that Yuli Spring
can enhance cultivation

33:42.550 --> 33:44.070
has caused many demons
to neglect their proper cultivation

33:44.070 --> 33:46.070
and focus only on finding
the celestial mountain.

33:46.070 --> 33:48.070
I suspect the Ao Hen Clan
keeps stirring up trouble

33:48.070 --> 33:49.350
and killing other demons

33:49.350 --> 33:51.210
must be connected to this matter.

33:52.000 --> 33:54.200
With many issues unresolved
among the demon clans,

33:54.200 --> 33:56.800
everyone is waiting for you
to uphold justice.

33:56.830 --> 33:58.790
If you marry a human at this time,

33:58.920 --> 34:00.830
it will likely cause unease
among all clans.

34:00.830 --> 34:02.150
Yes, Dragon Lord.

34:03.400 --> 34:05.270
If the Dragon Lord doesn't marry Hong Ye,

34:05.270 --> 34:08.000
will everyone
stop seeking the Yuli Spring?

34:09.000 --> 34:09.670
Long Yu!

34:10.150 --> 34:12.010
Since becoming the Azure Dragon,

34:12.150 --> 34:14.440
our Lord has settled disputes
and protected the weak,

34:14.440 --> 34:15.400
never indulging in luxury,

34:15.400 --> 34:17.320
and never acting arrogantly toward anyone.

34:17.320 --> 34:18.230
From great demons

34:18.230 --> 34:19.190
down to the flowers and grass,

34:19.190 --> 34:20.989
she treats all with utmost care.

34:21.000 --> 34:22.960
Just for Long Zhi's tribulation,

34:23.110 --> 34:24.770
she put in tremendous effort.

34:25.070 --> 34:26.030
In my opinion,

34:26.590 --> 34:29.400
the Dragon Lord
has never done anything harmful to demons,

34:29.400 --> 34:31.199
so we should trust her decision.

34:31.440 --> 34:33.630
Secondly, speaking of status,

34:33.800 --> 34:35.440
no one ranks higher than the Azure Dragon.

34:35.440 --> 34:37.880
You surely don't intend to use status
to restrict the Dragon Lord

34:37.880 --> 34:39.230
and condemn her
to lifelong solitude, right?

34:39.230 --> 34:39.630
Well...

34:39.630 --> 34:40.070
I...

34:42.000 --> 34:43.139
Marriage matters

34:43.230 --> 34:45.230
are ultimately
the Dragon Lord's personal affair.

34:45.230 --> 34:46.510
Even if Hong Ye is unworthy,

34:46.510 --> 34:48.320
it's only a matter of a hundred years,

34:48.320 --> 34:49.960
which has almost no impact for demons

34:49.960 --> 34:51.270
and the Dragon Lord.

34:51.630 --> 34:54.190
If she can't even make
a hundred-year decision for herself,

34:54.190 --> 34:55.320
then that's no fun.

34:55.710 --> 34:56.320
In the future,

34:56.320 --> 34:58.650
who would want to become the Azure Dragon?

35:08.760 --> 35:10.160
Rest assured, everyone.

35:10.260 --> 35:13.060
I haven't forgotten my duties
as the Azure Dragon.

35:13.190 --> 35:14.510
I, Xiao Yao, promise

35:15.150 --> 35:16.280
that before the wedding,

35:16.280 --> 35:19.210
I will resolve all issues
affecting the demon clans.

35:19.320 --> 35:20.150
-Yes!
-Yes!

35:51.150 --> 35:51.710
Yao,

35:51.840 --> 35:53.500
you've finally come to see me.

35:55.280 --> 35:56.480
Drinking alone?

35:57.760 --> 36:00.110
It's not as good
as what I gave you before.

36:00.640 --> 36:01.700
If you hadn't come,

36:01.710 --> 36:04.570
I wouldn't have brought out
those good wines at all.

36:06.030 --> 36:07.090
I've come to see you

36:07.320 --> 36:09.050
to borrow the Mist Pearl again.

36:14.910 --> 36:17.180
You lost Hong Ye again?

36:18.360 --> 36:20.280
This is a sacred treasure
of your entire clan,

36:20.280 --> 36:22.280
yet you carry it around so casually.

36:22.960 --> 36:24.090
If I carry it with me,

36:24.150 --> 36:25.440
then it's my responsibility.

36:25.440 --> 36:26.960
If I didn't keep it with me,

36:27.730 --> 36:29.630
then it would be
the entire clan's responsibility.

36:29.630 --> 36:31.580
I don't even consider it a treasure,

36:31.580 --> 36:33.840
so being casual about it doesn't matter.

36:34.340 --> 36:34.840
Wait.

36:35.510 --> 36:36.910
Let me stand further away

36:36.960 --> 36:37.960
before you start.

36:38.360 --> 36:40.360
I don't want to see Hong Ye's face.

36:41.440 --> 36:42.770
I'm not here to find him.

36:43.400 --> 36:45.590
The Ao Hen Clan
has gained notoriety lately,

36:45.590 --> 36:48.290
but I've searched everywhere
and couldn't find him.

36:48.290 --> 36:49.370
I want to see

36:49.400 --> 36:50.880
if he's hiding because he truly fears

36:50.880 --> 36:51.940
that I'll kill him.

36:52.670 --> 36:54.330
If he really did those things,

36:54.510 --> 36:56.370
he should know hiding is useless.

37:08.610 --> 37:09.570
I, Ao Hen,

37:10.000 --> 37:11.800
never care about my reputation.

37:13.840 --> 37:15.760
But when I heard that several major clans

37:15.760 --> 37:17.970
went to the Dragon Lord
to address the situation,

37:17.970 --> 37:19.630
I was actually quite pleased.

37:20.210 --> 37:22.170
Clearing the undeserved infamy

37:22.200 --> 37:23.280
of the Ao Hen Clan

37:23.510 --> 37:24.840
wouldn't be a bad thing.

37:25.590 --> 37:26.720
But I never expected

37:27.320 --> 37:29.960
that even the Dragon Lord
who protects all beings

37:29.960 --> 37:31.490
would believe such rumors.

37:32.110 --> 37:33.870
If it weren't for finding out the truth,

37:33.870 --> 37:36.200
I wouldn't be
the only one looking for you.

37:38.990 --> 37:40.550
If I say I didn't do it,

37:41.710 --> 37:42.910
would you believe me?

37:43.670 --> 37:45.150
Then at least tell me

37:45.170 --> 37:46.840
where you were during those days,

37:46.840 --> 37:47.840
what you did,

37:48.070 --> 37:49.270
and who can verify it.

37:51.880 --> 37:53.080
I have nothing to say.

37:54.550 --> 37:56.070
Various clans have lost their pearls

37:56.070 --> 37:57.630
and countless lives have been lost.

37:57.630 --> 38:00.090
The demon world
has never been in such chaos.

38:00.150 --> 38:01.440
If you truly didn't do it,

38:01.440 --> 38:03.190
you should join everyone

38:03.190 --> 38:05.390
to work together and uncover the truth.

38:08.360 --> 38:10.750
The Ao Hen Clan wasn't attacked.

38:10.920 --> 38:12.780
Our Universe Pearl is untouched.

38:13.280 --> 38:14.860
Why should I care about other clans?

38:14.860 --> 38:15.780
My affairs

38:16.280 --> 38:18.070
are none of your business.

38:18.070 --> 38:19.590
If you refuse to cooperate,

38:19.590 --> 38:21.280
then I'll have to take you back
to the Dragon Palace

38:21.280 --> 38:22.340
to deal with later.

38:25.480 --> 38:25.960
Wait!

38:26.710 --> 38:28.250
I can vouch for him.

38:28.550 --> 38:30.510
This really wasn't Ao Hen's doing.

38:30.800 --> 38:31.320
Shut up!

38:32.400 --> 38:33.070
At a time like this,

38:33.070 --> 38:35.150
you're still worried about your pride?

38:35.150 --> 38:35.760
Yao,

38:35.840 --> 38:37.800
since you took Hong Ye
away from Mount Yangxu,

38:37.800 --> 38:38.960
he's been here every day,

38:38.960 --> 38:40.550
feeling both ashamed and sorrowful.

38:40.550 --> 38:41.190
He's been taking me

38:41.190 --> 38:42.960
to drink heavily in this forest.

38:42.960 --> 38:43.920
Teng She, stop talking!

38:43.920 --> 38:46.000
He had no time to steal pearls!

38:56.110 --> 38:57.070
Xiao Yao and I

38:58.630 --> 39:00.290
went from enemies to friends.

39:00.920 --> 39:02.670
Now, because of a human,

39:03.360 --> 39:04.510
she hates me.

39:05.050 --> 39:07.510
What's so special
about that Hong Ye anyway?

39:08.110 --> 39:09.480
Has the world changed?

39:09.900 --> 39:12.570
Isn't might supposed to make right?

39:12.960 --> 39:13.760
Right?

39:17.110 --> 39:18.240
I don't understand.

39:19.710 --> 39:20.760
I regret it too.

39:21.230 --> 39:21.840
Tell me,

39:23.360 --> 39:25.160
should I go apologize to Xiao Yao

39:25.480 --> 39:27.080
and beg for her forgiveness?

39:27.320 --> 39:28.320
Say something!

39:29.800 --> 39:30.400
Yes!

39:30.630 --> 39:31.110
No.

39:31.190 --> 39:31.920
I shouldn't.

39:31.950 --> 39:34.080
I, Ao Hen, am full of pride and dignity.

39:34.110 --> 39:34.920
I'm harsh to others

39:34.920 --> 39:36.070
and even harsher to myself.

39:36.070 --> 39:37.590
Even when facing death...

39:39.230 --> 39:40.960
I will never lose my composure.

39:42.920 --> 39:43.780
Yes...

39:44.360 --> 39:45.360
Serves you right.

39:51.110 --> 39:52.760
I, Ao Hen, swear to heaven.

39:53.320 --> 39:54.320
From now on,

39:56.070 --> 39:57.840
if I ever wrong Xiao Yao...

40:03.320 --> 40:05.920
May I be struck by lightning.

40:12.280 --> 40:13.840
When he made that vow,

40:14.030 --> 40:15.030
the sky was clear,

40:15.190 --> 40:16.590
with no lightning in sight.

40:16.590 --> 40:17.480
It proves that

40:18.000 --> 40:19.030
he was sincere.

40:20.280 --> 40:21.610
I believe what you said.

40:22.480 --> 40:23.360
But this way,

40:24.110 --> 40:25.440
things are even worse.

40:26.510 --> 40:27.150
See,

40:27.360 --> 40:28.690
Yao still believes you.

40:29.440 --> 40:30.500
She may believe me,

40:32.280 --> 40:33.940
but I've lost all dignity now.

40:36.190 --> 40:37.150
Then let's

40:37.400 --> 40:38.230
find out the truth together.
